OL,3,AMan jailed for murdering fiancee he
OL,4,A'love bombed'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man with a history of violence
OL,7,Fagainst former partners has been jailed
OL,8,Ffor life for murdering his fiancee.
OL,10,FJack Johns, 53, killed 51-year-old
OL,11,FMalgorzata Wiktor, also known as Gosia,
OL,12,Fsix months into their relationship
OL,13,Fafter "love bombing" her when they met,
OL,14,FLeeds Crown Court heard.
OL,16,FGosia and her friends and family had
OL,17,Fraised concerns about Johns's "intense"
OL,18,Fbehaviour in the days and weeks before
OL,19,Fher death on 11 June this year.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
