OL,5,
OL,6,FSentencing the defendant to a minimum
OL,7,Fof 29 years in prison, Judge Tom
OL,8,FBayliss KC described him as an
OL,9,F"obsessive, possessive, domineering and
OL,10,Funstable individual", telling him: "You
OL,11,Fare, Jack Johns, an extremely dangerous
OL,12,Fman."
